DYWYPI is the message you get everytime you die in nethack. So if
someone writes DYWYPI it usually means "and then I died".

> BTW: Is it still possible, although i've used search on nearly every part of
> the level, that there is no way to go on?

There's always a way to go on - sometimes you have to search more than
one time to find a hidden passage and sometimes the way to go on is not
something as obvious as a staircase down, but that doesn't happen untill
very late in the game.

